---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import OlerPhoto from './assets/oler-photo.jpg'
---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#FFF3D1]">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2" style="min-height: 80vh;">
    <div class="relative">
      <Image
        src={OlerPhoto}
        alt="Oler Oladele, CFA"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        style="min-height: 420px;"
      />
      <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 px-4 py-2 text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-bold bg-[#FFD100] text-black">
        The Facilitator
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="p-8 md:p-16 flex flex-col justify-center">
      <div class="text-xs tracking-[0.4em] uppercase font-bold text-[#CC9200] mb-6">Meet Oler</div>
      <h3 class="text-black font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-8" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.25rem);">
        Securities trader turned
        <em class="italic font-medium text-[#CC9200]"> financial educator.</em>
      </h3>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-black/75 leading-relaxed max-w-lg">
        <p>As a CFA Charterholder, I've spent years helping professionals just like you overcome financial fear and build a recession-proof future.</p>
        <p>My mission is to bridge the knowledge gap and hand you real tools not vibes to take control of your financial destiny.</p>
        <p class="font-semibold text-black">This lab is one of my ways of helping you get started on the right path.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
